# Phase 162b: the Moon map opens from a button.
#
# The owner could not find the Moon map: it opened only with Y and the
# command palette. It now has MOON on the left rail, under GOTO, and
# MOON MAP beside GOTO SELECTED on the GoTo panel. Each press opens or
# closes it.

name    Moon map: the buttons open it
timeout 120

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Moon map
wait   3
press  MOON
expect 10  [MOONMAP] map shown
shot   rail-opened
press  MOON
expect 10  [MOONMAP] map hidden
press  GOTO:TAB GOTO
press  GOTO:MOON MAP
expect 10  [MOONMAP] map shown
shot   goto-opened
press  GOTO:MOON MAP
expect 10  [MOONMAP] map hidden
